From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 04:23:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] servoshell: Move the headless window and event loop out of
 the desktop module

So that other ports can run headless too.

Validation: `./mach build --release` and `./mach build --ohos --release --no-package` succeed with this patch alone. At the top of the series, desktop `./mach test-wpt --release --processes 4 /infrastructure/` runs headless (185 tests); its unexpected results are the testdriver BiDi and Bluetooth ones that this series does not touch, the same as in a run of the series on plain upstream. `./mach test-tidy` passes.
AI-assisted: Yes (agent session; written by the agent, which also ran the checks above)
Signed-off-by: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
